Dragon Blast (2026-11-13): the Renut's caches (renut_pipelines.bin, pipeline_list.bin) in the runtime's cache_root
when it is set. Dragon Burst's SDK fork returned the app's data folder from GetExecutableFolder() on Android; Dragon
Blast's SDK returns the APK's read-only library folder, so the pipelines were never kept between boots.

diff --git a/app/src/renut_engine/gpu/banjo_renut_tuning.cpp b/app/src/renut_engine/gpu/banjo_renut_tuning.cpp
--- a/app/src/renut_engine/gpu/banjo_renut_tuning.cpp
